Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.010
There's always room for dessert.

2
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.090
Here's a sweet idea just for you.

3
00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:08.923
Hey hey, Drew.

4
00:00:08.923 --> 00:00:10.930 line:15%
It's Marlynn Schotland with Urban Bliss Life

5
00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.220 line:15%
and today, I'm gonna show you

6
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:17.220 line:15%
how to make these easy and oh so adorable mini pecan pies.

7
00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:21.210
First, spray a mini muffin pan with nonstick cooking spray

8
00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:24.000
or grease each of the cup openings with butter.

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.900
Set the pan aside and start on the crust.

10
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.160
These mini pecan pies

11
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.460
start with either store-bought refrigerated pie crust

12
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.660
or your favorite homemade pie crust recipe.

13
00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.730
Roll out the pie crust

14
00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:38.450
and use a round cookie cutter to cut out circles.

15
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:41.923
You should end up with anywhere from 15 to 18 circles.

16
00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.640
Gently push each pie dough circle into a mini muffin cup

17
00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:49.650
pressing the dough along the sides as well.

18
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.540
If you accidentally create a hole in the crust

19
00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:52.373
while doing this,

20
00:00:52.373 --> 00:00:55.700
simply push the dough together until there are no holes.

21
00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.920
Next, sprinkle the chopped pecans into each cup

22
00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.670
just enough until the pecans almost reach the top

23
00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:02.900
of each opening.

24
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.350
This will be about one tablespoon full.

25
00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:08.070
In a large bowl, whisk together the brown sugar,

26
00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:12.580
corn syrup, vanilla, egg, egg white and salt.

27
00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:14.930
Spoon about two teaspoons of this filling

28
00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:17.253
over the pecans in each muffin cup.

29
00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:22.020
Bake the mini pecan pies at 350 degrees Fahrenheit

30
00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.120
for 18 to 20 minutes

31
00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:26.750
just until the tops are slightly puffed up

32
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:30.050
and the tops and sides of the crust are golden brown.

33
00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:31.060
Remove from the oven

34
00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:33.390
and allow the mini pies to cool in the pan

35
00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:34.680
for about five minutes

36
00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:38.350
before carefully lifting each mini pie out of the pan.

37
00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:41.560
These mini pecan pies are a great make-ahead party dish

38
00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:43.420
since you can eat them warmed up

39
00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:46.620
and they're just as delicious served at room temperature.

40
00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.320
Happy baking.

41
00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:52.073
I'm gonna be thinking about that all day long.

